For _**authenticated tenant**_, modifies a list of incidents by changing provided fields and values.
  ```
  URL example --
  https://www.myshn.net/shnapi/rest/external/api/v1/modifyIncidents
  ```
  ```
  Payload example --
  [
    {
      "incidentId":"ANO-1234",
      "changeRequests":{
        "WORKFLOW_STATUS":"RESOLVED"
      }
    },
    {
      {
      "incidentId":"AUD-4567",
      "changeRequests":{
        "WORKFLOW_STATUS":"OPENED"
      }
    },
    ...
  ]
  ```
